defaultEngagement.body:
Subject: The year

{{client.name}},

A year in, here is what actually got done, because it is easy to lose track of it a quarter at a time.

{{YEAR_SUMMARY}}

What is still open, honestly: {{OPEN}}

What I think next year is for: {{NEXT}}

That last one is a proposal, not a decision. Push back on it and we will use the first quarter to argue it out.

Thank you for a good year of this. It is genuinely more interesting work than most of what I do.

{{ADVISOR}}

Subject: {{SUBJECT}}

One idea this month.

{{IDEA}}

Why it matters to you specifically: {{WHY}}

The one thing worth doing about it: {{ACTION}}

That is all. If you want to talk about it, call me.

{{ADVISOR}}

Thanks for the note. Short answer: {{GENERAL_PRINCIPLE}}.

The longer answer depends on things I would rather ask you than assume. If you want, twenty minutes on the phone and I will tell you what I would look at first. If it turns out you do not need me, I will tell you that too.

{{ADVISOR}}
